{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "58877380bdbd25f73430c1f0510da12ac2598fd9e1c081cf19ce3ffb4ddef925", "ja": "この間のトッテモタカイツリー、\nすっごく楽しかったネ♪", "zh": "之前去高耸入云塔那次，\n真的玩得好开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "18d7688dc9ee20ce3eea93368b012568dfa2f7c362ef33de026132e0dda24e89", "ja": "はい！　トッテモタカイタウンのプラネタリウムも、\nとってもキレイでしたよね♪", "zh": "对呀！高耸入云城的天象馆，\n里面也非常漂亮呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "f71f21dae7334079fda74a0c05837be1326bfffbaa816518e2d8755ee81a3529", "ja": "ちょうど太陽特集やってたなんて、\nなんだか運命感じちゃうよねっ♪", "zh": "而且还正好在做太阳特辑，\n有种命运的感觉呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf0b214de675fad4dad3bfb3c9a80b2bc5b9bfcc48ace6a41576d0e325afe88b", "ja": "太陽の周りをいろんな星が回ってるの、\nダンスみたいでとってもキレイだったヨー♪", "zh": "太阳的周围有许多星星在运转，\n看起来就像跳舞一样非常漂亮呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "8c42cf46500d5b9b427de3fdd977e25aa72f9893f74e32fdbe2d86390e1bb489", "ja": "そうそう、太陽を中心に、いろんな惑星が手を\n繋いでるみたいに見えて！　素敵だったな～。", "zh": "对对，各个行星就像以太阳为中心，\n手牵手围成圈圈！很美妙呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "88f68b25f0028027baa247ea5c73643c0a7c6fa7f4fe98c3815b112b1fe9961d", "ja": "太陽みたいに、ピッカピカに輝いて！\nファンのみんなの心をあったかくしたいな～♪", "zh": "真想像太阳一样散发闪亮光芒！\n为所有粉丝们的心中带来暖意喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b7f18552dff1f5aafe0c00e03db1b3250ba87f32d191cccb99fb910ca219e84e", "ja": "（この間のトッテモタカイツリーと、その後に寄った\nプラネタリウム。やっぱりいい影響がでてるみたいだ）", "zh": "（之前去了高耸入云塔，后来又去参观天象馆，\n看来确实有为她们带来正面影响。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "0728a9373d5feeb79ab6e35e9ef5815095de95019cd1230a1e454dd4621d9e71", "ja": "そうだ！\nワタシ、いいこと思いついたヨー！", "zh": "对了！\n我想到一个好主意喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "bb2285292f26acd2c0600567c618de6663e23c4e06b3ef4756e3835d044dc342", "ja": "『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』用の、\nかけ声を作ったらどうかナ？", "zh": "来打造『阳光律动管弦乐♪』专用的口号，\n大家觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0afc58622b2de444abfdd0c7789f90589119823b6540f399af35327db2cdc99", "ja": "あ、賛成で～す！　そうしましょ～、作りましょ～♪\n{$P$}さん、いいですよねっ？", "zh": "啊，我赞成～！就这么办吧～大家一起构思吧～♪\n{$P$}先生，可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "15fe131d83d34f504bb97b9241699b8a26228cb765263a0254f29080a2529c10", "ja": "もちろん！\n早速みんなで意見を出し合ってみようか。", "zh": "当然好！\n那大家就立刻来提出意见吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "3f006e28a3fa584c7d303512f63df363cc1d9c2a98835456c4b2e86d385663dc", "ja": "それじゃあ、\n「ほっかほかの大盛りで～す！」なんてどうかな？", "zh": "那就「特大碗的暖洋洋～！」\n大家觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "024694b82240cb6233abd16616d58c8489de23f6d9ffbb8cd2fd955c172d0260", "ja": "うーん……。\n出前みたいになっちゃうカナ？", "zh": "呃……\n感觉会变成像在送外卖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "0d8ca6ef51a7d417c66e3835dda02dbac1055127dda64a71d075cd0c32f30c94", "ja": "なら、「お手てつないでランラララーン♪」とか！", "zh": "那么，「手牵手啦啦啦啦～♪」这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "fbda630421fb70ad7d7c74955a275a8e8787d2e8ba73693c6058f19dced8ac99", "ja": "なるほど～。でも、かけ声っていうより、\nいつもの可奈ちゃんの歌って感じだね？", "zh": "原来如此～不过这与其说是口号，\n更像是可奈平常唱的歌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "57cc747b4eaf0562b819ff9aa0fe9b849ace4947514d258b05969ecd976cc8ee", "ja": "それじゃ、\n「みんなでダンスダンス！　踊ろうヨ！」はどう？", "zh": "那不然，\n「大家一起跳舞跳舞！跳起来吧！」如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "8ad75ce3838181c99839572e715f8ef6e75d83dece250082cfbd4489aaf31a2c", "ja": "そ、それはそれで、\nいつものエレナさんって感じです！", "zh": "这、这听起来，\n也像平常的艾琳娜一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "361b41c4ca533cdb2112c6d5a88ac2e808cc848db912c10faa9bcaa09b196958", "ja": "3人の案も悪くはないが、\n決め手にかける感じだな……。", "zh": "三位的提议都不差，\n但是都没有什么决定性的感觉啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "79dcb81051d243a647d6e108aaf435e655c71883043378c5753cc274fd2c2fb8", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ～。", "zh": "大家，久等了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "241f10881a68a5cbf9f46e022b7994a77820339cc7c057c62b6d3b1038ff7fdd", "ja": "あっ、ひなたちゃん、翼ちゃん！\nラジオのお仕事、終わったの？", "zh": "啊，小日、小翼！\n广播的工作结束啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3def95ab031bb6c04b3cebdce42ec6aabdb318effd46cf71b1cc11d4f8a8a88c", "ja": "うんっ。『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演、\nぜったい来てねって、いっぱい宣伝しておいたよ♪", "zh": "嗯，我们有努力宣传，\n请大家一定要来看『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5b74e0fe8ff5666456501e059478bd0b8df887dd195d1ae0bf5cb2a3b2b2a339", "ja": "それで、みんなで集まって何の話？", "zh": "话说，大家聚在一起在讨论什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "2d6cd0354e61acf25408b2d47e4d5e440f2fdb3299f87a664469f254a3952093", "ja": "『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』の\nかけ声を考えてたんだヨっ♪", "zh": "我们正在想『阳光律动管弦乐♪』\n要用的口号唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "e03f16ad536498ba5e5cd15399cb17ec73f346aa2f6d49f0195a2edae75be46f", "ja": "翼ちゃんとひなたちゃんも、一緒に考えよう！\nこういうのは、みんなで考えなくちゃねっ♪", "zh": "小翼和日向也一起来帮忙想吧！\n这种事就应该大家一起集思广益嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "762bd75dc7bdbe4dd672f4c3eefd3e5ddf390d9c437839c16fbe5ece42a3b53e", "ja": "あはっ、そうですよね～。前に作りましたけど、\nみんなでいろいろ考えるの、結構楽しいし♪", "zh": "啊哈，这么说也是耶～之前我也创过口号，\n当时大家一起想了好多，还挺开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "4bde2d991b9dc8c03262966bba2237e79938c0cbd39bab7b5356f819851e34a6", "ja": "したっけ、お日さまらしいのがいいんだろか……。\nう～ん……。", "zh": "这样哪，有太阳公公气息的口号会比较好吧……\n唔～嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "461d4541cae32186c0a3f2ae00eb0da9b15914e4b8c57a31327503f5183d3612", "ja": "「輪になって歌おう」とか、どうだい？\nほら、お日さまって、まん丸だからねぇ。", "zh": "「围成一圈歌唱吧」如何哪？\n因为太阳公公圆圆的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2877439546d47290af27a04d5457d18976bc1583733cc5ade5f3dedd145d3830", "ja": "おお～……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "2877439546d47290af27a04d5457d18976bc1583733cc5ade5f3dedd145d3830", "ja": "おお～……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "2877439546d47290af27a04d5457d18976bc1583733cc5ade5f3dedd145d3830", "ja": "おお～……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "2877439546d47290af27a04d5457d18976bc1583733cc5ade5f3dedd145d3830", "ja": "おお～……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "d5ad5252b58b093df273d040872638180d1eec64af923cff02bbf734df68c79d", "ja": "うん！　とってもステキだと思うよ、ひなたちゃん♪", "zh": "嗯！我觉得非常棒喔，日向♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "59ee12b81fd4dc6e1a8bca7b90c609e640e245b56427c46c0fa5a9b517c5cafe", "ja": "あっ、名前も「日なた」ちゃん、だもんね！\nさすがひなたちゃん！　日なたならお任せ～♪", "zh": "啊，刚好你的名字就叫「日向」嘛！\n不愧是小日！太阳的事就交给你了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_03_1038_035hin", "source_sha256": "97013a9c418d6a1e3958967ab07cc31694ef95e79b518a1d8bfa89ff00697d2b", "ja": "そ、そんな……恥ずかしいべさ……。", "zh": "怎、怎么这样……好害羞哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
